  "subject": "情报学研究科_数理工学",
  "text": "求 $f(x)=\\sqrt{1+\\sin x}$ 在 $x=0$ 处的泰勒展开 $f(x)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} a_n x^n$ 中的常数 $a_0, a_1, a_2, a_3$。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "泰勒展开",
    "复合函数展开",
    "三角恒等式",
    "二项级数"
  ],
  "question_type": "泰勒展开系数求解",
  "method": [
    "利用恒等式 $1+\\sin x=(\\sin(x/2)+\\cos(x/2))^2$ 化简为初等函数之和后展开",
    "直接二项级数展开法作为验证"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "利用二倍角公式 $(\\sin(x/2)+\\cos(x/2))^2=1+2\\sin(x/2)\\cos(x/2)=1+\\sin x$，得 $f(x)=\\cos(x/2)+\\sin(x/2)$（在 $x=0$ 附近取正值）",
    "分别写出 $\\cos(x/2)$ 与 $\\sin(x/2)$ 的麦克劳林级数到 $x^3$ 项",
    "两式相加合并同类项得到 $a_0,a_1,a_2,a_3$",
    "用直接对 $u=\\sin x$ 做二项级数 $\\sqrt{1+u}=1+u/2-u^2/8+u^3/16-\\cdots$ 展开验证结果一致"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "taylor_expansion_composite",
    "template": "f(x)=\\sqrt{1+\\sin x}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a_n x^n, 求 a_0,a_1,a_2,a_3",
    "variable_count": 4
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "a0,a1,a2,a3",
      "steps": [
        "由 $1+\\sin x=(\\cos(x/2)+\\sin(x/2))^2$，且当 $x$ 靠近 $0$ 时 $\\cos(x/2)+\\sin(x/2)>0$，故 $f(x)=\\cos(x/2)+\\sin(x/2)$",
        "$\\cos(x/2)=1-\\dfrac{x^2}{8}+O(x^4)$，$\\sin(x/2)=\\dfrac{x}{2}-\\dfrac{x^3}{48}+O(x^5)$",
        "相加：$f(x)=1+\\dfrac{x}{2}-\\dfrac{x^2}{8}-\\dfrac{x^3}{48}+O(x^4)$",
        "验证：令 $u=\\sin x=x-\\dfrac{x^3}{6}+O(x^5)$，$\\sqrt{1+u}=1+\\dfrac{u}{2}-\\dfrac{u^2}{8}+\\dfrac{u^3}{16}-\\cdots$，代入得同样结果 $1+\\dfrac{x}{2}-\\dfrac{x^2}{8}-\\dfrac{x^3}{48}$",
        "结论：$a_0=1,\\ a_1=\\dfrac12,\\ a_2=-\\dfrac18,\\ a_3=-\\dfrac{1}{48}$"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
